<title>FRANCE: EU to hold food aid tenders on February 11 - ONIC.</title>
<headline>EU to hold food aid tenders on February 11 - ONIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will hold tenders on February 11 for the supply of EU rice, wheat flour and oats as food aid, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The tenders are to supply 2,300 tonnes of white rice to Chad, 100 tonnes of wheat flour to Georgia, 80 tonnes of wheat flour and 60 tonnes of oats to Peru and 2,160 tonnes of white rice to Haiti, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
